Chrissy: Holy moly was a nice touch.

21
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:55,600
迈克:谢谢.
Mike: Thanks.

22
00:00:56,700 --> 00:01:00,400
克莉丝:你知道,你看起来就像那喜欢讲催眠故事的人.
Chrissy: You know, you look like the kind of guy who would enjoy a good

23
