42
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:45,900
诺曼:你想再次发动?
Norman: Do you wanna pull the lever again?

43
00:03:45,900 --> 00:03:46,000
开萝尔:不,太吵了.你想进来喝杯咖啡吗?
Carol: No, it's too noisy.Would you like to come in for some coffee?

44
00:03:49,900 --> 00:03:55,400
诺曼:当然.我想喝咖啡.
Norman: Sure.I don't want coffee.

45
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:55,500
开萝尔:我也不.
Carol: Neither do I.

46
00:03:55,500 --> 00:03:55,600
克莉丝:嗨,开萝尔!
Chrissy: Hi, Carol!

47
00:03:55,600 --> 00:03:55,700
开萝尔:克莉丝,这时候你出来在这干什么?
Carol: Chrissy, what are you doing out here at this hour?

48
00:03:55,700 --> 00:03:57,440
克莉丝:不是亲吻垃圾工.
Chrissy: Not kissing the garbage man.

49
