克莉丝:小心!你几乎踩到它的尾巴了.
Chrissy: Watch it!You almost stepped on his tail.

55
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:36,300
开萝尔:尾巴!
Carol: Tail!

56
00:04:36,300 --> 00:04:36,400
克莉丝:是呀,艾克是只老鼠!
Chrissy: Yeah, Ike's a mouse!

57
00:04:36,400 --> 00:04:36,500
诺曼:这个小孩精神不正常.
Norman: Little babe's bonkers.

58
00:04:36,500 --> 00:04:36,600
克莉丝:再说这样的脏话,他会咬你脖子.
Chrissy: One more crack like that, he'll bite you on the neck!

59
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:37,520
开萝尔:诺玛,就当她不存在.她只是个小……啤酒!你把啤酒拿到这干什么?
Carol: Norman, just ignore her.She's just a little...beer!What's beer doing out here?

60
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:56,300
克莉丝:放松点,为艾克准备的.可以让它吃奶酪更顺畅.
Chrissy: Relax, it's just for Ike.It makes the cheese go down smoother.

61
00:04:56,300 --> 00:05:00,300
开萝尔:克莉丝,我不希望听到有关这个看不到的老鼠的胡话.
Carol: Chrissy, I don't wanna hear any more nonsense about this invisible mouse.

62
00:05:00,300 --> 00:05:00,400
克莉丝:你看不见他?
Chrissy: You don't see him?

63
00:05:01,200 --> 00:05:02,000
开萝尔:看不见.
Carol: No.

64
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:02,100
克莉丝:他在盯着你看.你这个家伙,在盯着你看.
Chrissy: He's staring at you.Boy, is he staring at you.

65
00:05:02,100 --> 00:05:02,200
诺曼:你知道的,开萝尔,也许今晚就到此结束吧.
Norman: You know, Carol, maybe we should call it a night.

66
