Carol: I don't think so.After her mouse drove Norman away...he was checking me out.

93
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:53,200
杰森:我们在这里说谁的幻觉呢?哈哈.我们这是在说谁的幻觉啊?哈哈.布德科利尔
Jason: Who's imagination are we dealing with here?Ha ha.Bud Collier.

94
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:53,300
麦琪:说什么.
Maggie: Excuse me.

95
00:06:53,300 --> 00:06:53,400
杰森:我虚幻中的朋友.布德科利尔.记着吗?大型演出的主办者,哦,是五十场的演出.他曾经创作了"真相","敲打的时钟"
Jason: That was my imaginary friend.Bud Collier.Remember, big game show host...oh all the big shows of the fifties.He used to do "Tell the Truth", "Beat the clock".

96
00:06:53,400 --> 00:06:53,500
麦琪:杰森,我知道他是谁了.
Maggie: Jason, I know who he was.

97
00:06:53,500 --> 00:06:54,600
杰森:不错,当我还是克莉丝这么大的时候,
Jason: Yeah, when I was Chrissy's age, I'd pretend he'd come over to visit.

98
00:06:55,760 --> 00:07:00,800
我装着他来看望我.他猜我的职业.每次都猜对.
He used to guess my occupation.Got it right every time.

99
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:03,020
麦琪:晚安,小甜心.
Maggie: Good night, sweetheart.

100
00:07:19,300 --> 00:07:20,200
杰森:噢.
Jason: Well.

101
00:07:20,200 --> 00:07:20,300
麦琪:,噢,什么?
Maggie: Well, what?

102
00:07:20,300 --> 00:07:20,400
杰森:那么谁是你虚的朋友?
Jason: Well, who was your imaginary friend?

103
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:20,500
麦琪:杰森,很晚了.
Maggie: Jason, it's late.

104
00:07:24,100 --> 00:07:33,000
杰森:哦,快点,麦琪.我们结婚这么些年,你还没有告诉我谁是你虚幻的朋友.虽然我知道你的每件事情,包括你右大腿内侧的胎记.
Jason: Oh, come on, Maggie.We've been married all these years, you've never told me who your imaginary friend is.And I know every thing about you, including that mole on your inner right thigh.

105
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:39,200
麦琪:啊!我右大腿内侧没有胎记.
Maggie: Ah!I don't have a mole on my inner right thigh.

106
00:07:39,200 --> 00:07:39,300
杰森:哦,好了.
Jason: Oh, OK.

107
00:07:42,900 --> 00:07:43,900
麦琪:杰森.
Maggie: Jason.

108
00:07:43,900 --> 00:07:44,000
杰森:只是开玩笑,麦琪.行了!有虚幻的朋友也不是什么害羞的事情.研究表明几乎所有有创造性的人都有虚幻的朋友.
Jason: Just kidding, Maggie.Come on!It's not anything to be ashamed of having an imaginary friend.Studies show that almost all creative people have had one.

109
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:44,100
麦琪:啊,我没有.
Maggie: Well, I didn't.

110
00:07:55,500 --> 00:07:59,100
杰森:也许,"朋友"这词重了.也许,只是和你讲话的虚幻的人.
Jason: Maybe, "friend" is too strong a word.Maybe, imaginary person that you talked to.

111
00:07:59,100 --> 00:07:59,500
麦琪:不是.
Maggie: No.

112
00:07:59,500 --> 00:07:59,600
杰森:不是?一种植物.
Jason: No?A plant.

113
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:01,200
麦琪:不是.
Maggie: No.

114
00:08:01,200 --> 00:08:01,300
杰森:也许一种动物.
Jason: Maybe an animal.

115
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:02,100
麦琪:噢!
Maggie: Oh!

116
00:08:02,100 --> 00:08:02,200
杰森:你是否曾经有个蚂蚁场,麦琪?
Jason: Have you ever had an ant farm, Maggie?

117
00:08:02,200 --> 00:08:02,300
麦琪:杰森!别说了.我不明白和一个游戏节目主持人说话使得人具有Jason,别说了,我可不明白跟一个电视知识竞赛主持人谈话是怎么让人变得具有创造性的.
Maggie: Jason!Just save it.I fail to see how talking to a game show host, makes one creative.

118
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:16,000
杰森:哦,好了,进被窝,然后我会告诉你你赢了什么.你去哪儿?
Jason: Oh, well, come under the covers and I'll show you what you've won!Where are you going?

119
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:16,100
麦琪:我想看看二号门后面有什么.
Maggie: I prefer to see what's behind door number two.

120
00:08:16,100 --> 00:08:16,200
杰森:嗨,布德,我们是在哪里看到那胎记的?
Jason: Hey, Bud, where were we when we saw that mole?

121
00:08:31,880 --> 00:08:34,140
麦琪:哦,有人吃光了奶酪.
Maggie: Well, somebody ate all the cheese.

122
00:08:49,100 --> 00:08:53,000
克莉丝:不,你先.
Chrissy: No, after you.

123
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:55,100
杰森:你好,小甜心,今天早上感觉怎么样?
Jason: Hi sweetheart, how are you doing this morning?

124
00:08:55,100 --> 00:08:55,200
克莉丝:很好.
Chrissy: I'm great.

125
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:55,300
麦琪:早餐需要点什么,克莉丝?
Maggie: What would you like for breakfast, Chrissy?

126
00:08:55,300 --> 00:08:55,400
克莉丝:麦片,鸡蛋,吐丝面包,烤薄饼,华夫饼干,面包…..
Chrissy: Oatmeal, eggs, toast, pancakes, waffles, bread...

127
00:09:02,800 --> 00:09:06,200
杰森:哇,哇,哇.是克莉丝还是本?
Jason: Wow, wow, wow.Is that Chrissy or Ben?

128
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:08,800
克莉丝:他认为,这都是我的.
Chrissy: He thinks, it's all for me.

129
00:09:08,800 --> 00:09:10,200
麦琪:小甜心,你在跟谁说话呢?
Maggie: Sweetheart, who are you talking to?

130
00:09:10,200 --> 00:09:11,100
克莉丝:(尖叫)
Chrissy: (Screams)

131
00:09:11,100 --> 00:09:11,500
麦琪:怎么了?
Maggie: What?

132
00:09:11,500 --> 00:09:13,900
克莉丝:你差点压扁他!
Chrissy: You almost smooshed him!

133
00:09:13,900 --> 00:09:15,900
麦琪:我差点压扁谁?
Maggie: I almost smooshed who?

134
00:09:15,900 --> 00:09:16,000
克莉丝:对不起,艾克.她一直坐这那的.
Chrissy: Sorry about that Ike.She always sits there.

135
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:16,100
杰森:哦,我明白了.这就是艾克.嗨,艾克,你怎么样?麦琪,跟艾克打招呼.
Jason: Oh, I get it.This is Ike.Hey, Ike, how you doing?Maggie, say hello to Ike.

136
00:09:16,100 --> 00:09:16,240
麦琪:哦,你好,艾克?对此我感觉不舒服.
Maggie: Oh, how do you do, Ike?I'm not very comfortable with this.

137
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:20,040
克莉丝:艾克说,哎呀,你看起来真年轻!
Chrissy: Ike says, holy moly, you look so young!

138
00:09:20,560 --> 00:09:24,200
麦琪:哦,一个女人从来不会对来自啮齿动物的赞美感到厌烦的.
Maggie: Oh, well, a woman never gets tired of hearing that from a rodent.

139
00:09:26,260 --> 00:09:28,920
哦,谢谢.
Oh, thank you.Do you like my blouse?

140
00:09:29,800 --> 00:09:32,800
你喜欢我的衬衫吗?我认为这能显示出我头发的美丽.
I think it brings out the highlights in my hair.Thank you.

141
00:09:32,920 --> 00:09:35,980
谢谢.你是只非常可爱的老鼠.
You are a very nice mouse.

142
00:09:49,500 --> 00:09:54,300
克莉丝:妈妈,他去洗手间了.
Chrissy: Mom, he went to the bathroom.

143
00:09:54,300 --> 00:09:54,400
麦琪:哦,洗手间.
Maggie: Oh, the bathroom.

144
00:09:54,400 --> 00:09:54,500
杰森:你冲马桶了?
Jason: Did you flush the toilet?

145
00:09:54,500 --> 00:09:54,600
开萝尔:是的,别问我这样的问题.
Carol: Yes, stop asking me that.

146
00:10:04,400 --> 00:10:06,600
克莉丝:开萝尔,这是艾克的椅子.
Chrissy: Carol, this is Ike's chair.

147
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:07,200
开萝尔:艾克.
Carol: Ike.

148
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:07,300
麦琪:他坐在这吃早饭
Maggie: He's here for breakfast.

149
00:10:09,400 --> 00:10:12,000
克莉丝:不,现在不在这.他在洗手间.
Chrissy: Not now he isn't.He's in the bathroom.

150
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:12,100
开萝尔:跟我同时在那里!
Carol: While I was in there!

151
00:10:13,800 --> 00:10:14,800
麦琪:开萝尔!
Maggie: Carol!

152
00:10:14,800 --> 00:10:14,900
克莉丝:艾克和我出去玩了.
Chrissy: Ike and I are going outside to play.

153
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:22,000
麦琪:好的,亲爱的,你早饭……我叫你,你和艾克的早饭准备好的时候我叫你们.
Maggie: OK, honey, I'll call you when your break...I'll call you and Ike when your breakfast is ready.

154
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:24,800
克莉丝:好的.快点,艾克.
Chrissy: OK.Come on Ike.

155
00:10:24,800 --> 00:10:24,900
开萝尔 :你真为他准备早餐?
Carol: Are you really gonna cook him breakfast?

156
00:10:24,900 --> 00:10:25,000
杰森:当然不.他是虚幻的.
Jason: Of course not.He's imaginary.

157
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:25,100
开萝尔:哦,我就不明白你们会和她玩到什么程度.
Carol: Well, I just didn't know how far you'd go to humour the little nut bar.

158
00:10:25,100 --> 00:10:25,940
本:你们知道不知道你的女儿在车道上自言自语?
Ben: Did you know your daughter's in the driveway talking to herself?

159
00:10:26,140 --> 00:10:28,000
开萝尔:不,她在和她的虚幻朋友说话.
Carol: No, she's talking to her imaginary friend.

160
00:10:28,920 --> 00:10:29,640
本:虚幻朋友!
Ben: Imaginary friend!

161
00:10:30,180 --> 00:10:32,160
杰森:是呀.就像你和萨姆海盗.
Jason: Yeah.Like you and Pirate Sam.

162
00:10:47,100 --> 00:10:50,200
本:萨姆海盗不是真实的?
Ben: Pirated Sam wasn't real?

163
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:50,300
杰森:他对你是真实的,然后你长大就忘记他了,本.
Jason: He was to you, and then you outgrew him, Ben.

164
00:10:50,300 --> 00:10:50,400
本:他告诉我他要出海了.我去躺下了.
Ben: He told me he had to ship out.I gotta go lie down.

165
00:11:00,300 --> 00:11:04,300
麦琪:杰森,克莉丝在那里一个劲的说话.
Maggie: Jason, Chrissy is doing an awful lot of talking out there.

166
00:11:04,300 --> 00:11:08,000
杰森:好的,布德,我们该对这样的妻子做些什么?
Jason: OK Bud, what are we gonna do about the wife?

167
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:10,900
麦琪:好,好,我知道我没什么好担心的.
Maggie: OK, OK, I know I've got nothing to worry about.

168
00:11:10,900 --> 00:11:11,000
开萝尔:那么如果没有人需要我,我就拿着垃圾在路边.
Carol: Well if anybody needs me, I'll be sitting on the curb with the trash.

169
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:11,100
杰森:行了,麦琪!克莉丝知道现实和虚幻的区别的.如果她不知道,我们得担心.
Jason: Come on, Maggie!Chrissy knows the difference between real and pretend.If she didn't then we'd have to worry.

170
00:11:11,100 --> 00:11:11,200
克莉丝:我们有进口啤酒吗?
Chrissy: Do we have any imported beer?

171
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:11,860
麦琪:给艾克的?
Maggie: For Ike?

172
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:26,300
克莉丝:是的.
Chrissy: Yeah!

173
00:11:26,300 --> 00:11:26,400
麦琪:没有.
Maggie: Forget it.

174
00:11:26,400 --> 00:11:26,500
克莉丝:对不起,艾克,他们说健康食品对你更有好处.
Chrissy: Sorry, Ike, they said something healthy was better for you.

175
00:11:26,500 --> 00:11:28,000
艾克:他们担心我的健康,然而却在家里到处布下了陷阱.我不明白.身体健康.
Ike: They're worried about my health, yet they're setting traps all over the house.I

176
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:29,280
don't get it.Salut

177
00:11:37,460 --> 00:11:38,600
杰森:嗨,我走了.
Jason: Well, I'm off.

178
00:11:50,900 --> 00:11:54,000
麦琪:好的,亲爱的,一天愉快.去看看病吧.
Maggie: OK, honey, have a good day.Go forth and cure.

179
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:54,900
杰森:你没事吧?
Jason: Are you alright?

180
00:11:54,900 --> 00:11:55,000
麦琪:这只是个玩笑.
Maggie: It was a joke.

181
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:55,100
杰森:我是说克莉丝和……你知道的,艾克.
Jason: I was referring to Chrissy and...you know, Ike.

182
00:11:55,100 --> 00:11:55,200
麦琪:哦,亲爱的,你提醒我了.我们之前已经经历过了.
Maggie: Oh, honey, you're reminding me.We've been through all this before.There's absolutely nothing to worry about.

183
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:55,300
杰森:拜拜,亲爱的,一天愉快.
Jason: Bye bye honey, have a nice day.

184
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:56,480
艾克:我会的,亲爱的.
Ike: I will dear.

185
00:12:10,600 --> 00:12:12,900
麦琪:克莉丝,该上学了.
Maggie: Chrissy, time for school.

186
00:12:12,900 --> 00:12:13,000
艾克:哦,不,我要离开我!
Ike: Oh no, you're leaving me!

187
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:13,100
克莉丝:妈妈,艾克就没有人玩了.
Chrissy: Mom, Ike's not gonna have anyone to play with.

188
00:12:17,800 --> 00:12:23,300
麦琪:他不会的.这样……也许艾克希望和你一起去.
Maggie: He won't.Well...maybe Ike would like to come with you.

189
00:12:23,300 --> 00:12:25,700
克莉丝:艾克,你想和我一起上学吗?
Chrissy: Ike, do you wanna go to school with me?

190
00:12:25,700 --> 00:12:25,800
艾克:哦,是呀!
Ike: Oh, yes!

191
00:12:25,800 --> 00:12:25,900
克莉丝:他想去.
Chrissy: He'd love to go.

192
00:12:29,300 --> 00:12:36,000
麦琪:很好.瞧,我可以处理这事.我其他孩子是非常正常的.
Maggie: Wonderful.See, I can handle this.My other children turned out perfectly normal.

193
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:36,100
开萝尔:你就拿了我的垃圾就走了!我觉得太习惯了.
Carol: You just take my trash and leave!I feel so used.

194
00:12:42,100 --> 00:12:44,700
艾克:啊,哇,很好的邻居关系.
Ike: Ah, wow, nice neighbourhood.

195
00:12:44,700 --> 00:12:44,800
克莉丝:我们喜欢.
Chrissy: We like it.

196
00:12:44,800 --> 00:12:44,900
麦琪:我们喜欢什么,亲爱的?
Maggie: We like what, honey?

197
00:12:47,100 --> 00:12:48,300
克莉丝:邻居关系.
Chrissy: The neighbourhood.

198
00:12:48,300 --> 00:12:48,400
艾克:什么,她是聋子?
Ike: What, is she deaf?

199
00:12:49,800 --> 00:12:51,200
克莉丝:有时候.
Chrissy: Sometimes.

200
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:51,300
麦琪:有时候,什么呀?
Maggie: Sometimes, what?

201
00:12:51,300 --> 00:12:51,400
艾克:告诉她没有什么.
Ike: Tell her to forget it.

202
00:12:51,400 --> 00:12:51,500
克莉丝:没有什么,妈妈.
Chrissy: Forget it, Mom.

203
00:12:55,100 --> 00:12:56,800
麦琪:好的.
Maggie: OK.

204
00:12:56,800 --> 00:12:58,400
克莉丝:想唱歌吗,艾克?
Chrissy: Wanna sing a song, Ike?

205
00:12:58,400 --> 00:13:00,500
艾克:好呀,你说对了.
Ike: Yeah, you bet.

206
00:13:00,500 --> 00:13:00,600
克莉丝:哪首歌好?
Chrissy: What's a good song?

207
00:13:00,600 --> 00:13:00,700
麦琪:怎么样……滴答,滴答,钟声响?
Maggie: How about...Hickory, Dickory, Dock?

208
00:13:00,700 --> 00:13:00,800
艾克:听着,我拒绝唱这首小老鼠怕小捕鼠器.下一首.
Ike: Look, I refuse to sing a song about a weenie little mouse who's afraid of a little tick-tock.Next.

209
00:13:00,800 --> 00:13:01,180
克莉丝:那么"溪谷里的农夫"?
Chrissy: How about The farmer in the Dell?

210
00:13:13,800 --> 00:13:16,300
麦琪:呵,滴答,滴答,钟声响怎么不好了?
Maggie: Ooh, what was wrong with Hickory Dickory Dock?

211
00:13:16,300 --> 00:13:16,400
克莉丝:你使艾克生气了.
Chrissy: You're upsetting Ike.

212
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:24,400
艾克:好了,但是当我们唱到那部分,耗子吃了奶酪,为了兄弟,我希望改成老鼠.
Ike: OK, but when we get to the part about, the rat takes the cheese, in honour of the brothers, I'd like to make it a mouse.

213
00:13:24,400 --> 00:13:27,600
克莉丝:我知道了.还有……(唱歌)溪谷里的农夫……
Chrissy: You got it.And...(singing) The farmer in the dell...

214
00:13:27,600 --> 00:13:34,700
艾克:大声一点!克莉丝和艾克一起唱 溪谷里的农夫,嗨嗬,                                                                           牛奶场 哦,溪谷里的农夫.
Ike: A little louder!Chrissy and Ike singing together: The farmer in the dell, hi ho, the dairy o, the farmer in the dell.

215
00:13:34,700 --> 00:13:34,800
麦琪:我可以加入吗?
Maggie: Can I join you guys?

216
00:13:35,700 --> 00:13:36,600
克莉丝:当然.
Chrissy: Sure.

217
00:13:36,600 --> 00:13:40,700
一起:(唱歌)老鼠吃了奶酪,老鼠吃了奶酪……
Together: (singing) The mouse takes the cheese, the mouse takes the cheese...

218
00:13:40,700 --> 00:13:40,800
麦琪:嗨嗬,牛奶场 哦,耗子吃了奶酪!我唱错了吗?
Maggie: Hi ho, the dairy o, the rat takes the cheese!Am I doing it wrong?

219
00:13:40,800 --> 00:13:41,120
克莉丝:你怎么问这个问题,妈妈,当艾克和你一起唱,他对于耗子有什么感受呢?
Chrissy: How can you ask that, Mom, when Ike shared with you how he felt

220
00:13:41,120 --> 00:13:42,100
about rats

221
00:13:54,300 --> 00:14:01,500
艾克:啊,你知道,她讨厌我.这种事情一直发生在我身上.太困难了,做一只美国老鼠.
Ike: Ah, you know, she hates me.This happens to me all the time.It's tough being a rodent American.

222
00:14:01,500 --> 00:14:08,600
麦琪:小甜心,你知道现实和虚幻的区别吗?
Maggie: Sweetheart, do you know the difference between really real and...make-believe?

223
00:14:08,600 --> 00:14:08,700
克莉丝:当然知道.虚幻就是蝙蝠侠.
Chrissy: Of course I do.Make-believe is Bat man.

224
00:14:11,700 --> 00:14:12,600
麦琪:对.
Maggie: Right.

225
00:14:12,600 --> 00:14:12,700
克莉丝:而真正的现实是圣诞老人.
Chrissy: And really real is Santa Claus!!

226
00:14:22,900 --> 00:14:24,600
艾克:那么,这是学校!
Ike: So, this is school!

227
00:14:24,600 --> 00:14:28,500
克莉丝:是的.跟着我,我会告诉你比利 奥尼尔在什么地方让自己难堪的.
Chrissy: Yes.Follow me, I'll show you where Billy O'Neill embarrassed himself.

228
00:14:28,500 --> 00:14:30,100
麦琪:好的.
Maggie: OK.

229
00:14:30,100 --> 00:14:32,200
克莉丝:不是你,妈妈,艾克.
Chrissy: Not you, Mom, Ike.

230
00:14:32,200 --> 00:14:37,100
麦琪:哦.
Maggie: Oh.

231
00:14:37,100 --> 00:14:38,700
老师:麦琪,一切都好?
Teacher: Maggie, is everything alright?

232
00:14:38,700 --> 00:14:38,800
麦琪:当然.我是说,你为什么这么问?
Maggie: Of course.I mean, why do you ask?

233
00:14:40,800 --> 00:14:42,700
老师:是这样,就因为从你看克莉丝的方式.
Teacher: Well, just because from the way you were looking at Chrissy...

234
00:14:42,700 --> 00:14:45,500
麦琪:克莉丝没有什么问题.她十分正常.
Maggie: There is nothing wrong with Chrissy.She is perfectly normal.

235
00:14:45,500 --> 00:14:46,400
老师:我知道.
Teacher: I know.

236
00:14:46,400 --> 00:14:46,500
麦琪:我是说,她正常,是吗?我是说,我不希望从你那里听到不正常.我是说,我明白她正常.我是个好父母,而你只是个老师.不,不,不.我是说,只是一个老师,我是说……
Maggie: I mean, she is normal, right?I mean, not that I need to hear that from you.I mean, I can see that she's normal.I'm a good parent and you're just a teacher.No, no, no.I didn't mean, just a teacher, I meant...

237
00:14:56,700 --> 00:15:01,400
老师:你想来分享圈讨论这些叫做感觉的东西吗?
Teacher: Would you like to come to the share circle and discuss these things called feelings?

238
00:15:01,400 --> 00:15:01,500
麦琪:哦,不,谢谢,萨莉.我真的……得走了.但是现在我在这,克莉丝有做什么事情吗,说些什么……比如老鼠.
Maggie: Oh, no thanks, Sally.I really...have to be going.But while I'm here, has Chrissy been doing anything, talking about anything...mouse-like.

239
00:15:02,080 --> 00:15:04,720
老师:让我想想.哦,她有一天用花生酱黄油三明治去交换奶酪三明治.你是不是担心什么?什么事情让你从镇上到这里?
Teacher: Let me think.Well, she did trade her peanut butter sandwich for a cheese

240
00:15:04,720 --> 00:15:08,440
sandwich the other day.Is something worrying you?

241
00:15:08,620 --> 00:15:10,100
What's taking you to frown town

242
00:15:23,900 --> 00:15:32,600
麦琪:哦,不……没什么……我没什么好担心的.没有提及,说,关于一个六英尺的老鼠,叫艾克.
Maggie: Oh, no...nothing...I have nothing to worry about.No mention, say, of a six foot mouse named Ike.

243
00:15:32,600 --> 00:15:33,700
老师:没有.
Teacher: No.

244
00:15:33,700 --> 00:15:33,800
麦琪:但是她一直在说六英尺老鼠.
Maggie: But she has been talking about a six foot mouse!

245
00:15:36,100 --> 00:15:38,100
老师:没有.
Teacher: No.

246
00:15:38,100 --> 00:15:38,200
麦琪:哦,好.今天待会见.萨莉,你是否认为有一个虚幻的朋友是……恩……有害?
Maggie: Oh, well.See you later today then.Sally, do you think having an imaginary friend is...errm...harmful?

247
00:15:38,760 --> 00:15:41,640
老师:哦,这不好说.你的虚幻朋友是谁?
Teacher: Well, that depends.Who's your imaginary friend?

248
00:15:42,720 --> 00:15:45,020
麦琪:不是我!克莉丝.
Maggie: Not me!Chrissy.

249
00:15:45,540 --> 00:15:47,720
老师:她有个虚幻朋友;很好.
Teacher: She's got an imaginary friend; that's wonderful.

250
00:15:48,060 --> 00:15:49,000
麦琪:是吗?
Maggie: It is?

251
00:15:49,360 --> 00:15:51,360
老师:噢,当然,是有创造性的强烈信号.
Teacher: Well, sure, it's a great sign of creativity.

252
00:15:51,960 --> 00:15:52,860
麦琪:我听说了.
Maggie: I've heard.

253
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:56,080
老师:而且这可以有时可以满足他们在生活中因为太小而说不清楚的需要.
Teacher: And it can sometimes fill a need in their life that they're too

254
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:57,000
young to articulate.

255
00:15:57,340 --> 00:16:00,440
克莉丝:妈妈在如此烦恼什么呢?你们大家伙知道吗?
Chrissy: What's my Mom so upset about?Do any of you guys know?

256
00:16:20,300 --> 00:16:26,100
老师:也就是说,她没有得到足够的注意.也许某人忽视她.你们家有叫艾克的吗?
Teacher: It means, she isn't getting enough attention.Maybe someone's ignoring her.Have you got an Ike in family?

257
00:16:26,100 --> 00:16:26,200
麦琪:没有,我们家有本,开萝尔,而且我们还有迈克.迈克,艾克.哦.
Maggie: No, we've got a Ben and a Carol, and we've got a Mike.Mike.Ike.Oh.

258
00:16:32,760 --> 00:16:35,260
艾克:我可以动一下吗,我的尾巴抽筋了?
Ike: Can I move, I'm getting a cramp in my tail?

259
00:16:47,400 --> 00:16:50,800
克莉丝:一点痘不能动,我还没有完成.
Chrissy: Don't move a whisker, I'm not finished.

260
00:16:50,800 --> 00:16:50,900
迈克:你说什么呢?
Mike: What'd you say?

261
00:16:50,900 --> 00:16:51,000
克莉丝:没有什么.我想你会喜欢的.
Chrissy: Nothing.I think you're gonna like this.

262
00:16:56,900 --> 00:17:02,000
本:她变的古怪了.我喜欢.
Ben: She's getting weird.I like it.

263
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:02,100
麦琪:迈克,再次谢谢你留在家里照看克莉丝.
Maggie: Mike, thanks again for staying home to watch Chrissy.

264
00:17:02,100 --> 00:17:02,200
迈克:哦,嗨,谢谢你先付钱给我.
Mike: Oh, hey, thank you for paying me in advance.

265
00:17:02,200 --> 00:17:03,560
麦琪:而且如果你和克莉丝晚上一起玩的开心的话,她可以迟点睡觉……你知道,八点,九点,十点……午夜.无论什么时候.
Maggie: And if you and Chrissy are having fun together tonight, she can stay up a little later...you know, eight, nine, ten...midnight.Whatever.

266
00:17:04,260 --> 00:17:05,580
本:为什么不是开萝尔照看?
Ben: Why isn't Carol babysitting?

267
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:19,900
迈克:她和那个垃圾工再次约会了.
Mike: She got another date with the garbage man.

268
00:17:19,900 --> 00:17:20,000
本:她约会!
Ben: She does!

269
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:20,100
迈克:是的.不要惊讶,本.我是说,那些是靠收垃圾为生的.
Mike: Yeah.Don't be surprised Benny.I mean, those guys take out trash for a living.

270
00:17:20,100 --> 00:17:20,200
艾克:他照看,有意思.
Ike: He is fun to watch.

271
00:17:20,200 --> 00:17:20,300
克莉丝:最好.
Chrissy: The best.

272
00:17:20,300 --> 00:17:20,400
杰森:露西,我回来了.
Jason: Lucy, I'm home.

273
00:17:31,700 --> 00:17:33,600
麦琪:好,迈克,你照看克莉丝.
Maggie: OK, Mike, you keep an eye on Chrissy.

274
00:17:33,600 --> 00:17:34,400
迈克:好的,妈妈.一定会.
Mike: OK, Mom.Sure will.

275
00:17:34,400 --> 00:17:39,700
麦琪:还有本,恩……走开.
Maggie: And Ben, err...go away.

276
00:17:39,700 --> 00:17:42,500
杰森:哇!真漂亮!什么场合?
Jason: Wow!Don't you look nice!What's the occasion?

277
00:17:42,500 --> 00:17:42,600
麦琪:哦,我带你出去吃晚饭.
Maggie: Well, I am taking you out to dinner.

278
00:17:45,500 --> 00:17:46,300
杰森:好呀.
Jason: OK.

279
00:17:46,300 --> 00:17:46,400
麦琪:那么,走吧,走吧,走吧.
Maggie: So, let's go, let's go, let's go.

280
00:17:46,400 --> 00:17:46,500
杰森:什么场合?
Jason: What's the occasion?

281
00:17:46,500 --> 00:17:46,600
麦琪:我们要站在这里回答二十个问题吗?难道就不能出去庆祝相爱的欢乐吗?
Maggie: Well do we have to stand here and play twenty questions?Can't we just go out and celebrate the joy of loving each other?

282
00:17:52,700 --> 00:17:53,400
杰森:好.
Jason: OK.

283
00:17:53,400 --> 00:17:53,500
麦琪:现在抹去你脸上愚蠢的表情.我们走吧.
Maggie: Now wipe that stupid look off your face.And let's move it.

284
00:17:53,500 --> 00:17:53,600
杰森:哦,我有一些事情,今天我在办公室追踪了一些小事情,尽管我应该有空余时间.有关于虚幻朋友的一些研究.你可能发现这些能使你安心.
Jason: Oh, I had a few things, just odds and ends that I tracked down at the office today, you know, while I had some spare time.Just some research about imaginary friends.You might find it kind of reassuring.

285
00:17:54,580 --> 00:17:56,480
麦琪:很好,亲爱的.
Maggie: Great honey.

286
00:17:56,480 --> 00:17:57,300
杰森:你在干什么?
Jason: What are you doing?

287
00:17:57,720 --> 00:18:01,260
麦琪:哦,你是对的,你是对的.我们可以使用便签纸的背面.
Maggie: Oh, you're right, you're right.We can use the back for scratch paper.

288
00:18:01,520 --> 00:18:02,760
杰森:不,麦琪,
Jason: No, Maggie, come on!

289
00:18:02,920 --> 00:18:04,500
行了!
Now here I was trying to ease your mind,

290
00:18:04,520 --> 00:18:06,240
现在我正试着让你放松,
and I come home to discover you're not worried at all.

291
00:18:06,240 --> 00:18:07,200
但是我回家却发现你一点也不担心.你怎么回事?
What's the matter with you?

292
00:18:19,800 --> 00:18:23,400
麦琪:哦,亲爱的,你会感觉好点,如果我哭的话?
Maggie: Oh, honey, would you feel better if I got all weepy?

293
00:18:23,400 --> 00:18:23,500
杰森:不,那不是我需要的.我不希望你那么脆弱和依赖.
Jason: No, that's not what I'm after.I don't want you all weak and needy.

294
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:34,800
麦琪:哦,甜心,我今天什么都没做对.我在克莉丝老师面前出了洋相,现在我想做的就是带你去吃晚餐.
Maggie: Oh, sweetheart, I can't do anything right today.I made a fool out of myself with Chrissy's teacher and all I wanna do is take you dinner.

295
00:18:34,800 --> 00:18:34,900
杰森:亲爱的,我们可以去吃晚餐.
Jason: Honey, we can go to dinner.

296
00:18:36,400 --> 00:18:37,600
麦琪:真的?
Maggie: Really?

297
00:18:37,600 --> 00:18:38,500
杰森:是的.
Jason: Yes.

298
00:18:38,500 --> 00:18:38,600
麦琪:哦,好.走吧,快点!
Maggie: Oh good.Let's go, come on!

299
00:18:41,600 --> 00:18:52,000
杰森:也许你能关注一下这些事情,在吃甜点或其他东西.
Jason: Maybe you could take a look at these over dessert or something.

300
00:18:52,000 --> 00:18:55,000
迈克:哇,哇,哇!克莉丝,我在楼下就能听到了!你在干什么?
Mike: Wow, wow, wow!Chrissy, I can hear you all the way downstairs!What are you doing?

301
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:55,100
克莉丝:这是艾克的主意.
Chrissy: It was Ike's idea.

302
00:18:55,100 --> 00:18:55,200
迈克:哦,是的.妈妈告诉我有关艾克的事情.
Mike: Oh, yeah.Mom told me about Ike.

303
00:18:58,600 --> 00:18:59,100
艾克:哦,哦!
Ike: Oh oh!

304
00:18:59,100 --> 00:19:05,900
迈克:现在,听着.你最好告诉艾克,如果他不希望有麻烦的话……同样,我要亲自告诉他.他在哪?
Mike: Now listen.You better tell Ike that if he doesn't wanna get in trouble that...Ditto, I'll tell him myself.where is he?

305
00:19:05,900 --> 00:19:06,000
克莉丝:就在那.
Chrissy: Right over there.

306
00:19:06,900 --> 00:19:08,300
迈克:哦.嗨,艾克!
Mike: OK.Hey Ike!

307
00:19:08,300 --> 00:19:09,400
艾克:是.
Ike: Yes.

308
00:19:09,400 --> 00:19:09,500
迈克:别跳上床.那边.我希望我没有粗暴的对他.
Mike: Don't jump on the bed.There.I hope I wasn't too rough on him.

309
00:19:09,500 --> 00:19:09,600
克莉丝:他活该.
Chrissy: He had it coming.

310
00:19:09,600 --> 00:19:09,700
艾克:他活该!
Ike: He did!

311
00:19:15,600 --> 00:19:17,300
克莉丝:迈克,想和我们玩吗?
Chrissy: Mike, wanna play with us?

312
00:19:17,300 --> 00:19:17,400
迈克:是,是,当然.你们在玩什么呢?
Mike: Yeah, yeah, sure.What are you guys playing?

313
00:19:19,500 --> 00:19:21,500
克莉丝:你想玩什么?
Chrissy: What do you wanna play?

314
00:19:21,500 --> 00:19:24,300
迈克:呃……我喜欢"茶话会".
Mike: Err...I kind o' like Tea Party.

315
00:19:24,300 --> 00:19:24,400
克莉丝:茶话会,好.听起来不错,对我而言.
Chrissy: Tea Party, sure.Sounds good to me.

316
00:19:27,100 --> 00:19:28,000
艾克:嗨!
Ike: Hey!

317
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:28,100
克莉丝:安静,艾克.
Chrissy: Chill out, Ike.

318
00:19:29,100 --> 00:19:32,500
迈克:是,安静,艾克.把他们竖起来,我要两块糖.
Mike: Yeah, chill out, Ike.Set 'em up and I'll have two lumps.

319
00:19:32,500 --> 00:19:32,600
艾克:是!我想给他两块糖.
Ike: Yeah!I'd like to give him two lumps.

320
00:19:32,600 --> 00:19:32,700
克莉丝:艾克,坐下,别像个孩子.
Chrissy: Ike, sit down and stop being a baby.

321
00:19:32,700 --> 00:19:32,800
艾克:我不想.
Ike: I don't wanna.

322
00:19:32,800 --> 00:19:32,900
克莉丝:好.坐在那,就那样.
Chrissy: Fine.Stay there, be that way.

323
00:19:42,500 --> 00:19:49,300
迈克:没有什么比老鼠有想法更糟了.小子,咖啡是热的.
Mike: Nothing worse than mouse with an attitude.Boy, this coffee's hot.

324
00:19:49,300 --> 00:19:49,400
克莉丝:是茶.
Chrissy: It's tea.

325
00:19:50,600 --> 00:19:54,200
艾克:哈!
Ike: Ha!

326
00:19:54,200 --> 00:19:55,540
迈克:在燃烧着的老鼠夹的火光中,老鼠先生意识到,他再也没有什么可害怕的了.最终,多年的游荡结束了.他最后还是回家了.结束.
Mike: And in the glow of the fire of the burning mouse traps, Mr.Mouse realised he had nothing to fear ever again.Finally, the years of wandering were over.He was home at last.The end.

327
00:20:07,900 --> 00:20:11,700
迈克和艾克:哦,哇,好故事!
Mike and Ike: Oh, wow, good story!

328
00:20:11,700 --> 00:20:13,600
克莉丝:你和艾克真的很像.
Chrissy: You and Ike are a lot alike.

329
00:20:13,600 --> 00:20:13,700
迈克:是呀,哪里像?我们的鼻子.
Mike: Yeah, what is it?Our noses.

330
00:20:15,900 --> 00:20:19,300
艾克:哦,它可以夹东西吗,你呢?
Ike: Oh, can it cute stuff, will you?

331
00:20:19,300 --> 00:20:19,400
克莉丝:你们不象.但是你们都有趣.我喜欢和你们玩.
Chrissy: You don't look alike.But you're both funny.I like playing with you guys.

332
00:20:23,600 --> 00:20:25,800
迈克:是,我也喜欢和你玩,克莉丝.
Mike: Yeah, I like playing with you too, Chrissy.

333
00:20:25,800 --> 00:20:25,900
克莉丝:你喜欢!
Chrissy: You do!

334
00:20:25,900 --> 00:20:26,000
迈克:是.别那么震惊.我是说,如果我不是经常这样做的话,这……哦有时我也喜欢和大女孩玩.
Mike: Yeah.Don't sound so shocked.I mean, if I don't do it all the time it's...well sometimes I like playing with the big girls too.

335
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:26,100
克莉丝:像,昨晚.
Chrissy: Like, last night.

336
00:20:35,300 --> 00:20:40,100
迈克:对.哦,你知道,就如你知道的那样.我今晚会免费照看你的.
Mike: Right.Well, you know, just so you know, I would have babysat you for free tonight.

337
00:20:40,100 --> 00:20:41,200
克莉丝:真的?
Chrissy: Really!

338
00:20:41,200 --> 00:20:42,600
艾克:哦,大英雄.
Ike: Oh, big hero.

339
00:20:42,600 --> 00:20:42,700
迈克:嗨,克莉丝,明天,我去给我的车打蜡,你能帮我吗?
Mike: Hey, Chrissy, tomorrow, I'm gonna wax my car, you wanna help me?

340
00:20:45,800 --> 00:20:46,800
克莉丝:真的!
Chrissy: Really!

341
00:20:46,800 --> 00:20:47,500
迈克:哦,好.
Mike: Oh, yeah!

342
00:20:47,500 --> 00:20:48,300
克莉丝:你要能让我碰你的车!
Chrissy: You'd let me touch your car!

343
00:20:48,300 --> 00:20:48,400
艾克:真烦人.
Ike: This is boring.

344
00:20:49,600 --> 00:20:51,900
迈克:七点整……早晨!
Mike: Seven O' clock sharp...am!

345
00:20:51,900 --> 00:20:52,000
克莉丝:你会起那么早!
Chrissy: You're getting up that early!

346
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:52,100
迈克:不.你.我八点三十需要用车,然后我可以带你去吃早饭.
Mike: No.You are.I need the car by eight thirty so I can take you to breakfast.

347
00:20:57,000 --> 00:20:57,500
克莉丝:行!
Chrissy: Alright!

348
00:20:57,500 --> 00:21:12,800
迈克:好.行,进被窝!睡觉吧.好.好好睡,金发.明早见.
Mike: OK.Alright, under the covers!Here you go.Good.Sleep tight, Goldie locks.See you in the morning.

349
00:21:12,800 --> 00:21:15,700
艾克:好,在我们被无礼中断之前,我们在哪?
Ike: OK, where were we before we were so rudely interrupted?

350
00:21:15,700 --> 00:21:17,400
克莉丝:艾克,睡觉啦.
Chrissy: Ike, it's bed time.

351
00:21:17,400 --> 00:21:20,200
艾克:哦,失败者现在睡觉!快点!我们玩.
Ike: Oh, bed time's for losers!Come on!Let's party.

352
00:21:20,200 --> 00:21:20,300
克莉丝:我在帮迈克,早上很早,清楚吗?
Chrissy: I'm helping Mike, early in the morning, remember?

353
00:21:20,300 --> 00:21:20,400
艾克:哦,因此你说,你宁愿明天给迈克的车打腊,而不是现在和我玩.
Ike: Oh, so you're saying you'd rather detail Mike's car tomorrow, rather than to play with me now!

354
00:21:20,400 --> 00:21:20,500
克莉丝:艾克,我要睡觉了
Chrissy: Ike, I gotta go to sleep.

355
00:21:30,300 --> 00:21:36,000
艾克:哦,好吧!好,那么,我想自己玩"茶话会".
Ike: Oh, well fine!OK, well, I wanted to play Tea Party by myself anyway.

356
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:47,600
克莉丝:好的.
Chrissy: OK.

357
00:21:47,600 --> 00:21:47,700
艾克:我在做什么?我是只长大的老鼠.
Ike: What am I doing?I'm a grown mouse.

358
00:21:55,000 --> 00:21:57,100
杰森:什么,所以在克莉丝学校你把所有的事情都说了.
Jason: What, so you put all this together at Chrissy's school.

359
00:21:57,100 --> 00:22:01,800
麦琪:没有,但是这样做有意义.克莉丝的确对迈克有英雄崇拜.
Maggie: No, but it does make sense.Chrissy does have this hero worship thing for Mike.

360
00:22:01,800 --> 00:22:03,100
杰森:是,那是真的.
Jason: Yeah, that's true.

361
00:22:03,100 --> 00:22:05,300
麦琪:因此,也许如果他们更多的时间在一起,她就不需要艾克.
Maggie: So, maybe if they spend more time together, she won't need Ike.

362
00:22:05,300 --> 00:22:10,800
杰森:亲爱的,我讨厌把你归到专业一类,但是我怀疑一晚上在一起会让艾克有什么不同.
Jason: Honey, I hate to pull professional rank on you, but I doubt if one evening together's gonna make any difference with Ike.

363
00:22:10,800 --> 00:22:14,300
艾克:是呀,你说的对.
杰森:你说什么了吗?
00:22:14,300
Ike: Yeah, says you. Jason: Did you say something?
